# @luminet/design-library

- TypeScript + React 18 peers; ship via tsup (ESM, CJS, d.ts).
- Tailwind v4: semantic tokens in `theme.css` only — no raw hex in components.
- Variants via CVA; merge classes with `src/lib/cn.ts`.
- Public API: `size` (xs|sm|md|lg), `variant` where applicable, `borderVariant` per taxonomy.
- Keep components presentational; no Inventory/Campaign business logic.
